  "note": "Lunenburg High School: the continuation of the LHS Faculty/Staff Roster that begins on page 135. THREE COLUMN GROUPS, and the first seven lines use a different encoding from the rest. Lines 1-7 are name-then-role with a wide gap: name at x=0.092-0.097 and role at x=0.291-0.292, paired by matching y (0.901/0.900, 0.831/0.831, 0.792/0.793, 0.759/0.756). Amanda Duggan, Jennifer Stadler and Todd Foster have no role printed beside them. None of lines 1-7 has a heading above it on this page, so grade_or_dept is '' for all seven; they continue something from page 135 and this page does not say what. From line 8 the page is two columns of bare names under headings: left x=0.093-0.097, right x=0.475-0.477. Line 24 prints TWO names side by side, 'Jose Martinez' at x=0.092 and 'John Sodano' at x=0.196, both in the left-hand Paraprofessionals column; they are two entries sharing line 24. Line 16 'Geraldine Sampson-Head' and line 17 'Richard Krafve- Lead' are read as a name plus a role under the Custodians heading and split accordingly -- the middle school page 131 prints the same person as 'Jeri Sampson, Head Custodian'. If either were instead a hyphenated surname the split would be wrong; nothing on the page settles it. Line 11 'Eleni Tsiakalos' is at OCR confidence 0.500. Line 8 is the only heading-only line (Guidance left, Cafeteria right). Line 25 is the printed page number 134."
